    "updated_at": "2020-03-16T22:41:21Z",
    "body": "See [this StackOverflow question](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/49078873/windows-10-webusb-printing-issues-with-zebra-lp2844-domexception-access-denied) for a solution.\r\n\r\nOn Windows you will get the \"Access denied\" error if the winusb.sys driver is not loaded. You can use the [Zadig](https://zadig.akeo.ie/) tool to force that driver to replace the default one for this device.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
