    "created_at": "2022-11-01T17:19:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-11-01T17:19:39Z",
    "body": "> On Windows you will get the \"Access denied\" error if the winusb.sys driver is not loaded. You can use the [Zadig](https://zadig.akeo.ie/) tool to force that driver to replace the default one for this device.\r\n\r\n@reillyeon I was able to install the winusb driver using Zadig, but I am still getting the \"Access denied\" error. Do you have any more insights on how to get this working?",
