    "body": "Ok thank you @reillyeon ! I was able to get the correct driver selected as you can see from my screenshot, but then calling `controlTransferOut` is causing the error \"Transfer failed: A device attached to the system is not functioning.\" The same call is working fine on a mac. The call to `controlTransferOut` looks like this\r\n\r\n```\r\ncontrolTransferOut({requestType: 'class', recipient: 'interface', request: 0x22, value: 0x01, index: 0x00})\r\n```\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/11875246/199305195-c35f172b-2655-43f5-9627-beeda9b5c625.png)\r\n",
